<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>A Little Sorry 🧡</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap');
  :root{--cream:#fff8e9;--brown:#79543d;--dark:#493326;--orange:#d99155;--peach:#f6d4ad;--sage:#a9b88b}
  *{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;color:var(--dark);background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%,#fff 0 2px,transparent 3px),linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8e9,#f8e3c8);background-size:35px 35px,auto;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;overflow-x:hidden}
  .card{width:min(100%,560px);background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);border:2px solid #f0d6b8;border-radius:30px;padding:34px 28px 30px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 18px 55px #79543d20;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .tag{display:inline-block;background:#edf1df;color:#65734e;padding:7px 15px;border-radius:30px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,8vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.05;margin:17px 0 8px;color:#69442f;font-weight:900}
  .subtitle{color:#98745a;margin:0;font-size:1rem}
  .scene{height:220px;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;margin:12px auto 8px}
  .sun{position:absolute;width:155px;height:155px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffe8a8;top:28px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);opacity:.8}
  .pond{position:absolute;bottom:22px;width:270px;height:42px;background:#c5d9d0;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(.2px)}
  .capy{position:relative;z-index:1;font-size:112px;filter:drop-shadow(0 9px 4px #79543d20);animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}
  .flower{position:absolute;font-size:28px;z-index:2}.f1{left:15%;top:55px}.f2{right:15%;top:70px}.f3{right:22%;bottom:32px;font-size:22px}
  @keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-9px)}}
  .message{font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.8;max-width:420px;margin:12px auto 20px;color:#72543f}
  .note{background:#fff4e4;border:1px dashed #e6bd91;border-radius:18px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 auto 22px;max-width:420px;font-weight:700;color:#79543d}
  button{border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 25px;background:#c77f4b;color:white;font:900 1rem 'Nunito',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #a9683d;transition:.15s}
  button:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 9px 0 #a9683d} button:active{transform:translateY(4px);box-shadow:0 3px 0 #a9683d}
  #reply{min-height:30px;margin:18px 0 0;color:#718052;font-weight:900}
  .footer{font-size:.78rem;color:#ad8b70;margin-top:22px}
  .heart{position:fixed;bottom:-30px;pointer-events:none;animation:rise 3.2s linear forwards;font-size:22px}
  @keyframes rise{to{transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(25deg);opacity:0}}
  @media(max-width:420px){.card{padding:28px 19px}.scene{height:190px}.capy{font-size:98px}.sun{width:135px;height:135px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="card">
  <span class="tag">a tiny apology delivery 🥕</span>
  <h1>Sorry Twin 😭😭</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Please accept this little capybara peace offering.</p>
  <div class="scene" aria-label="A cute capybara sitting beside a pond">
    <div class="sun"></div><div class="pond"></div>
    <span class="flower f1">🌼</span><span class="flower f2">🍃</span><span class="flower f3">🌷</span>
    <div class="capy">🦫</div>
  </div>
  <p class="message">I know I messed up, Twin, and I'm really sorry. I never wanted to hurt you or make you feel bad. You mean a lot to me, and I hope you can forgive me.</p>
  <div class="note">If I could, I'd send you a capybara with a basket of carrots and a big apology. 🧡<br><br><strong>Sorry Twin 😭😭</strong><br><br>Promise: Ithuku aprm ippadi panna matten. 🥺🤎</div>
  <button id="forgive">Tap if there's a tiny chance I’m forgiven 🥺</button>
  <p id="reply" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="footer">made with carrots, calm vibes & lots of care 🌿</div>
</main>
<script>
const button=document.getElementById('forgive');
const reply=document.getElementById('reply');
button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
  reply.textContent='YAY… sending you the biggest capybara hug! 🧡🦫';
  for(let i=0;i<18;i++){
    const heart=document.createElement('span');heart.className='heart';heart.textContent=['🧡','🤎','🥕','🌼'][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];
    heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';heart.style.animationDelay=Math.random()*.8+'s';document.body.appendChild(heart);
    setTimeout(()=>heart.remove(),4000);
  }
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
